#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/GoCardless.php
msgid "After a free order that renews (a free trial), a client without a saved payment method is sent to GoCardless to set up a Direct Debit."
msgstr "Efter en gratis ordre, der fornyes (en gratis prøveperiode), sendes en kunde uden en gemt betalingsmetode til GoCardless for at oprette en direkte debitering (Direct Debit)."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/Mollie.php
msgid "After a free order that renews (a free trial), a client without a saved payment method is sent to Mollie to save one."
msgstr "Efter en gratis ordre, der fornyes (en gratis prøveperiode), sendes en kunde uden en gemt betalingsmetode til Mollie for at gemme en."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/PayPalAutoPay.php
msgid "After a free order that renews (a free trial), a client without a saved payment method is sent to PayPal to set up automatic payments."
msgstr "Efter en gratis ordre, der fornyes (en gratis prøveperiode), sendes en kunde uden en gemt betalingsmetode til PayPal for at opsætte automatiske betalinger."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/PayTabs.php
msgid "After a free order that renews (a free trial), a client without a saved payment method is sent to PayTabs to save a card."
msgstr "Efter en gratis ordre, der fornyes (en gratis prøveperiode), sendes en kunde uden en gemt betalingsmetode til PayTabs for at gemme et kort."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/Eway.php
msgid "After a free order that renews (a free trial), a client without a saved payment method is sent to eWAY to save a card."
msgstr "Efter en gratis ordre, der fornyes (en gratis prøveperiode), sendes en kunde uden en gemt betalingsmetode til eWAY for at gemme et kort."

#: src/modules/Invoice/templates/admin/mod_invoice_settings_cards.html.twig
msgid "After a move from WHMCS with the same Stripe account: for each client without a saved card, takes the default card (or the newest card) of the Stripe customer with the client's email."
msgstr "Efter en flytning fra WHMCS med den samme Stripe-konto: for hver kunde uden et gemt kort tages standardkortet (eller det nyeste kort) fra Stripe-kunden med kundens e-mailadresse."

#: src/modules/Client/templates/admin/mod_client_settings.html.twig
msgid "After enabling this feature, existing users who have not yet confirmed their email addresses will also need to do so."
msgstr "Når denne funktion er aktiveret, skal eksisterende brugere, der endnu ikke har bekræftet deres e-mailadresse, også gøre det."

#: src/modules/Invoice/templates/admin/mod_invoice_gateways.html.twig
