#: src/themes/palisade/html/mod_support_tickets.html.twig
msgid "If our support team needs to sign in to your server, add the details here. They are encrypted at once, only authorized support staff can open them, every opening is shown on the ticket, and they are deleted when the ticket is closed. You can also add them later from the ticket page."
msgstr "Hvis vores supportteam skal logge ind på din server, så tilføj oplysningerne her. De krypteres med det samme, kun autoriseret supportpersonale kan åbne dem, hver åbning vises på sagen, og de slettes, når sagen lukkes. Du kan også tilføje dem senere fra sagens side."

#: src/modules/Support/templates/admin/mod_support_settings.html.twig
